            "target_entity_type": "Experiment",
            "paragraph": "Using the DSSAT model in a factorial design, the study simulated 13 treatment combinations with four nitrogen fertilizer rates (46, 69, 92, and 115 kg N ha\u00af\u00b9), three application timings (T1: single application at sowing; T2: split application half at sowing and half at tillering; T3: triple application one-fourth at sowing, half at tillering, and one-fourth at flowering), and one wheat cultivar (Dendea), chosen for its higher expected yield response in comparison to the Wane cultivar. Additionally, a control treatment without fertilizer was used. Simulations were conducted over a 35-year period of 2030-2064 (2050s) and 2065-2099 (2080s) under two scenarios (SSP4.5 & SSP8.5) in order to represent variability, and the results were examined using a randomized complete block design framework, where years served as replications for every climate scenario.",
